cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VegaDūta in your research or work, please cite it as below."
title: "VegaDūta: an open-source multi-tenant platform for AI agents and workflows"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The VegaDūta Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CD-LC/vegaduta"
url: "https://github.com/CD-LC/vegaduta"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  VegaDūta is a self-hostable, multi-tenant platform for building AI agents,
  orchestrating them in workflows with human approval, grounding them in
  tenant data, and connecting them to messaging channels. It supports the
  Model Context Protocol (client and server), Agent2Agent, AG-UI and
  OpenTelemetry.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - agentic-ai
  - model-context-protocol
  - a2a
  - workflow
  - rag
  - multi-tenant
